{"id": "1001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-03-02T01:10:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-03-02T01:10:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p><at id=\"0\">王强</at> 请教一下，AS110K 每天早上报 E037，中午又自己恢复了，客户很着急，客户电话 13800138000</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [{"id": 0, "mentionText": "王强", "mentioned": {"user": {"id": "u-2001", "displayName": "王强"}}}], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/1001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "1002", "replyToId": "1001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-03-02T01:11:10Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-03-02T01:11:10Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>补充：那边已经连续下了一周雨</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/1002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "1003", "replyToId": "1001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-03-02T01:25:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-03-02T01:25:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2001", "displayName": "王强", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<blockquote itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.skype.com/Reply\" itemid=\"1001\"><strong itemprop=\"mri\">李明</strong><span itemprop=\"time\" itemid=\"1001\"></span><p itemprop=\"preview\">请教一下，AS110K 每天早上报 E037...</p></blockquote><p>这是典型的潮湿导致绝缘下降。建议：</p><ol><li>重点检查 MC4 连接器有没有进水、有没有插到位</li><li>晴天上午断电后，用 1000V 绝缘测试仪逐路测每个组串对地绝缘，低于 1MΩ 的组串分段查</li></ol><p>测完把结果发我 <emoji id=\"1f440_eyes\" alt=\"👀\" title=\"Eyes\"></emoji></p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/1003?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "1004", "replyToId": "1001", "messageType": "systemEventMessage", "createdDateTime": "2026-03-02T02:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-03-02T02:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": {"@odata.type": "#microsoft.graph.membersAddedEventMessageDetail"}, "from": null, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<systemEventMessage/>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/1004?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "1005", "replyToId": "1001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-03-03T06:40:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-03-03T06:40:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>按您说的测了，第 2 路组串的 MC4 接头密封圈缺失进水了，换了 610-00045-A 之后好了 <emoji id=\"like\" alt=\"👍\" title=\"Like\"></emoji></p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/1005?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "1006", "replyToId": "1001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-03-03T06:41:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-03-03T06:41:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2001", "displayName": "王强", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p><emoji id=\"like\" alt=\"👍\" title=\"Like\"></emoji></p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/1006?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "2001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-04-10T08:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-04-10T08:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1002", "displayName": "Zhao Liu", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Hi team, several AS-250K-HV units trip with E063 over-temperature every afternoon. Ambient is about 46C. Any idea?</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/2001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "2002", "replyToId": "2001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-04-10T08:30:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-04-10T08:30:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2002", "displayName": "Mike Chen", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<div>Derating above 45 °C is normal, but E063 means the heat sink is above 85 °C. Please check:<br>1. Air filters (clean them)<br>2. External fan 310-04522-A spins<br>3. Clearance: 500 mm above, 300 mm each side</div>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/2002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "2003", "replyToId": "2001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-04-11T03:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-04-11T03:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1002", "displayName": "Zhao Liu", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Thanks Mike, the filters were full of sand. Cleaned them and it works now.</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/2003?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "3001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-06T02:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-06T02:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1003", "displayName": "孙七", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>AS-110K-HV 风扇坏了报 E051，机器是 2022 年出厂的，要订哪个料号？</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/3001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "3002", "replyToId": "3001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-06T02:20:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-06T02:20:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2003", "displayName": "周伟", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>用 310-04521-B，旧的 310-04521-A 已经停产了。2023 年之前出厂的要加风扇安装支架 730-00014-A，详见通告 <attachment id=\"att-1\"></attachment></p><codeblock class=\"plaintext\"><code>出厂年月 = 序列号第 5~8 位</code></codeblock>"}, "attachments": [{"id": "att-1", "contentType": "reference", "contentUrl": "https://example.sharepoint.com/sites/kb/SB-2025-014.pdf", "name": "SB-2025-014.pdf"}], "mentions": [], "reactions": [{"reactionType": "like", "displayName": "Like", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-06T02:30:00Z", "user": {"user": {"id": "u-1003", "displayName": "孙七"}}}], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/3002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "4001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-07T00:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-07T00:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": {"id": "bot-1", "displayName": "Ticket Bot", "applicationIdentityType": "bot"}, "device": null, "user": null}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>📊 Daily report: 12 tickets opened, 9 closed</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/4001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "5001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-08T03:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-08T03:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1003", "displayName": "孙七", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>有人知道现场没有网络的时候 AS-50K 怎么升级固件吗？</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/5001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "6001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-09T03:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-09T03:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": "2026-05-09T03:05:00Z", "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": ""}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/6001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "7001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>AS110K 侧盖螺丝扭矩打多少？</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/7001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "7002", "replyToId": "7001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:02:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:02:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1003", "displayName": "孙七", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>好像是 3 N·m 吧</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/7002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "7003", "replyToId": "7001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:10:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:10:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2003", "displayName": "周伟", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>不是 3。侧盖 730-00012-A 的 M5 螺丝扭矩 2.5 N·m，密封条要压到位，不然 IP66 保证不了。</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/7003?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "7004", "replyToId": "7001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:30:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-05-10T05:30:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>收到，按 2.5 打完了，没问题了，谢谢</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/7004?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "8001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-01T01:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-01T01:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-9999", "displayName": "临时账号", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>AS-110K-HV 早上报 E037，太阳出来以后自己恢复了，正常吗？</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/8001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "8002", "replyToId": "8001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-01T01:30:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-01T01:30:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2001", "displayName": "王强", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>清晨潮湿时绝缘阻抗下降，是 E037 的常见原因，阻抗恢复后会自动并网。建议检查 MC4 连接器是否进水，晴天逐路测量组串对地绝缘。</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/8002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "8003", "replyToId": "8001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-02T01:30:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-02T01:30:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-9999", "displayName": "临时账号", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>好的 查到了一个接头进水，已解决</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/8003?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "9001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-03T01:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-03T01:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": {"dlpAction": "BlockAccess", "verdictDetails": "AllowOverrideWithoutJustification"}, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1001", "displayName": "李明", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>客户的银行卡号是 ...</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/9001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "10001", "replyToId": null, "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-05T02:00:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-05T02:00:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-1003", "displayName": "孙七", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>AS-250K-HV 有一路组串可能正负接反了，W102 告警，能直接插上试试吗？</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/10001?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
{"id": "10002", "replyToId": "10001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-05T02:10:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-05T02:10:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2002", "displayName": "Mike Chen", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>Do NOT plug it in. Open the DC switch, measure polarity at the connector with a multimeter first (1500V system!), correct the wiring, then reconnect.</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/10002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
