{"id": "11002", "replyToId": "11001", "messageType": "message", "createdDateTime": "2026-06-07T02:15:00Z", "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-06-07T02:15:00Z", "lastEditedDateTime": null, "deletedDateTime": null, "subject": null, "importance": "normal", "locale": "en-us", "policyViolation": null, "eventDetail": null, "from": {"application": null, "device": null, "user": {"id": "u-2001", "displayName": "王强", "userIdentityType": "aadUser"}}, "body": {"contentType": "html", "content": "<p>指示窗变红说明交流防雷模块 520-00310-A 已经失效，尽快更换。断电后拔出旧模块插入新模块即可。</p>"}, "attachments": [], "mentions": [], "reactions": [], "channelIdentity": {"teamId": "a1b2c3d4-team-0001", "channelId": "19:support-channel@thread.tacv2"}, "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19:support-channel@thread.tacv2/11002?groupId=a1b2c3d4-team-0001"}
